# YFM × YWM Combined Design System

Blend **YWM CRM** layout polish with **YFM** brand identity. Reference: `maps-leads-crm/crm` (local).

## Keep from YFM (never replace)
- **Logos:** `src/assets/yfm-logo*` via `YfmLogo.tsx` — do not swap for YWM inline SVGs
- **Primary accent:** orange `#f89406` (bright `#fa9f1a`, dim `#e07d00`) — not YWM blue
- **Display font:** Plus Jakarta Sans for headings / logo areas
- **Motion:** auth backdrops, view transitions, orange glow on CTAs

## Take from YWM CRM
- **CSS variable tokens:** `--surface`, `--surface-raised`, `--surface-border`, `--content-*`
- **Card pattern:** `bg-surface-raised border border-surface-border rounded-xl`
- **UI font:** Inter for body, forms, tables
- **Shell class:** `.yfm-shell` with gray→token remapping (like `.crm-shell`)
- **Inputs:** rounded-lg/xl, border-surface-border, focus ring primary orange
- **Page density:** cleaner headers, less heavy glass on data views

## Tokens (dark mode — default)
| Token | Value |
|-------|-------|
| `--surface` | `#000000` |
| `--surface-raised` | `#111111` |
| `--surface-border` | `#262626` |
| `--content-text` | `#fafafa` |
| `--content-muted` | `#a3a3a3` |
| `--primary` (HSL) | `36 95% 50%` → `#f89406` |

## Tailwind usage
- Prefer `bg-surface-raised`, `border-surface-border`, `text-content`, `text-content-muted`
- Legacy `dark-*` and `brand-*` still work — map to same tokens
- Buttons: primary = orange; secondary = raised surface + border
- Cards: `rounded-xl` (CRM), not oversized `rounded-2xl` unless hero/marketing

## Do not
- Import MUI into YFM
- Switch primary to YWM blue `#2563eb`
- Remove orange animated backdrops from auth/splash flows
